DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTSTAMP:20261009T172918Z
UID:05f6716c02b3bea2aeaf7b35@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Two choices\, a scenic and more challenging 8 miler or less fr
 enzy-a 4 miler desert area course with flat canal stretches\, some weaving
