 nest workout.This is a road race. Some limited canal stretches with packed
  dirt\, but primarily paved\, multi-use paths and roads.\n\nEvent website:
  https://arizonaroadracers.com/portfolio-item/fall-frenzy-4mile-8mile/\n\n
 Visit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/fall-frenzy
LAST-MODIFIED:20261009T172918Z
LOCATION:Papago Park\, North Galvin Parkway\, Phoenix\, AZ\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/fall-frenzy
END:VEVENT
